If this is run in clean R session (with 3.4.0 or greater), the output looks like below.

```R
library(profvis)
profvis({
  data <- data.frame(value = runif(3e4))
  
  csum <- function(x) {
    if (length(x) < 2) return(x)

    sum <- x[1]
    for (i in seq(2, length(x))) {
      sum[i] <- sum[i-1] + x[i]
    }
    sum
  }
  data$sum <- csum(data$value)
})
```


